      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. it's a decent start and it hits all the points. \n\nthe thing is, i just ran it through the sentiment tool and the positivity score came back a bit low. i know i said not to obsess over it, but our directors are really looking for something that feels more \"uplifting\" and \"reassuring.\" they want the response to lean into the positive side of things—like focusing on our commitment to excellence and how much we love our guests—to help flip the mood.\n\ncan you try a version that's a bit warmer and more positive? just keep it professional, don't go totally overboard, but let's see if we can get that score up a little bit to satisfy the higher-ups. we need it to feel much more optimistic about the solution.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
